(7568898, 1214498, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>What an amazing building, well found and captured. I like that you have chosen to take the shot in the evening presumably to avoid the distractions of any people in the shot? Technically the shot is excellent with good DOF and detail throughout and taken from a position to show off the unique natural facade with its illumination. Another justly deserved winner for you Gin, congratulations.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well What an amazing building, well found and captured. I like that you have chosen to take the shot in the evening presumably to avoid the distractions of any people in the shot? Technically the shot is excellent with good DOF and detail throughout and taken from a position to show off the unique natural facade with its illumination. Another justly deserved winner for you Gin, congratulations.', '2018-05-21 04:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7568927, 1214498, 185714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sidpixel:</b></div><hr/><i> Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>What an amazing building, well found and captured. I like that you have chosen to take the shot in the evening presumably to avoid the distractions of any people in the shot? Technically the shot is excellent with good DOF and detail throughout and taken from a position to show off the unique natural facade with its illumination. Another justly deserved winner for you Gin, congratulations. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much for your kind comments.<br/> <br/>Greatly appreciated !<br/> <br/>cheers<br/>gin</td>', 'Originally posted by sidpixel: Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well What an amazing building, well found and captured. I like that you have chosen to take the shot in the evening presumably to avoid the distractions of any people in the shot? Technically the shot is excellent with good DOF and detail throughout and taken from a position to show off the unique natural facade with its illumination. Another justly deserved winner for you Gin, congratulations.   Thank you so much for your kind comments. Greatly appreciated ! cheersgin', '2018-05-21 12:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569014, 1214498, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great find. I wanted to photograph this building whilst we were in Japan <a href="https://inhabitat.com/organic-building-in-osaka-is-clad-with-plant-filled-pockets/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Gaetano Pesce vertical garden</a> but we didn''t have time :(</td>', 'Great find. I wanted to photograph this building whilst we were in Japan Gaetano Pesce vertical garden but we didn''t have time :(', '2018-05-22 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569192, 1214454, 136989, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>What a wonderful image for an earth-friendly challenge.  You''ve got green representing the environment, insects that play a huge role, and collaboration in getting the work done.  It''s no surprise to me at all that this image received a ribbon.  <br/> <br/>The details on the bugs are sharp and I love how the colors work together to soften the overall feel of the scene.  The ribbon-like waves of the leaf add depth and interest. As I stare at the scene I can almost hear two co-workers bickering back and forth over the idiot humans who are always disrupting their progress by trying to step on them. Beautiful!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! What a wonderful image for an earth-friendly challenge.  You''ve got green representing the environment, insects that play a huge role, and collaboration in getting the work done.  It''s no surprise to me at all that this image received a ribbon.   The details on the bugs are sharp and I love how the colors work together to soften the overall feel of the scene.  The ribbon-like waves of the leaf add depth and interest. As I stare at the scene I can almost hear two co-workers bickering back and forth over the idiot humans who are always disrupting their progress by trying to step on them. Beautiful!', '2018-05-24 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7569245, 1214454, 185772, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ciaeagle:</b></div><hr/><i> Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>What a wonderful image for an earth-friendly challenge.  You''ve got green representing the environment, insects that play a huge role, and collaboration in getting the work done.  It''s no surprise to me at all that this image received a ribbon.  <br/> <br/>The details on the bugs are sharp and I love how the colors work together to soften the overall feel of the scene.  The ribbon-like waves of the leaf add depth and interest. As I stare at the scene I can almost hear two co-workers bickering back and forth over the idiot humans who are always disrupting their progress by trying to step on them. Beautiful! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much for the wonderful critique! Greatly appreciated!</td>', 'Originally posted by ciaeagle: Greetings from the Critique Club! What a wonderful image for an earth-friendly challenge.  You''ve got green representing the environment, insects that play a huge role, and collaboration in getting the work done.  It''s no surprise to me at all that this image received a ribbon.   The details on the bugs are sharp and I love how the colors work together to soften the overall feel of the scene.  The ribbon-like waves of the leaf add depth and interest. As I stare at the scene I can almost hear two co-workers bickering back and forth over the idiot humans who are always disrupting their progress by trying to step on them. Beautiful!   Thank you very much for the wonderful critique! Greatly appreciated!', '2018-05-25 06:58:20.000000', NULL, 0);
